[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 3902.957, "timestamp": "01:05:02", "text": "我一直都很珍惜它們。我還在說話"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3909.363, "timestamp": "01:05:09", "text": "僅限於那個圈子的人，而不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3911.127, "timestamp": "01:05:11", "text": "我想過橋去找"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3919.17, "timestamp": "01:05:19", "text": "交更多朋友之類的。是的。但是就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3921.511, "timestamp": "01:05:21", "text": "Jonix，你可能認識我，我…"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3924.053, "timestamp": "01:05:24", "text": "連接器等。我與"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3926.662, "timestamp": "01:05:26", "text": "我與許多創作者合作過。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3930.526, "timestamp": "01:05:30", "text": "YouTube 上的那些人。能"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3932.787, "timestamp": "01:05:32", "text": "我可能看起來比較外向什麼的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3934.991, "timestamp": "01:05:34", "text": "所以，要嘛是個善於交際的人，要嘛就是其他什麼人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3937.2, "timestamp": "01:05:37", "text": "是。或許你越是注視我，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3939.194, "timestamp": "01:05:39", "text": "你會發現我有多內向。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3944.228, "timestamp": "01:05:44", "text": "存在。或者我只是喜歡聊天。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3946.692, "timestamp": "01:05:46", "text": "無論是我獨處的時候還是其他時候。呃，就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3948.827, "timestamp": "01:05:48", "text": "當我進行個人直播時。但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3950.607, "timestamp": "01:05:50", "text": "在群體傳播期間，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3956.212, "timestamp": "01:05:56", "text": "你會發現我幾乎不說話。之後"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 3958.916, "timestamp": "01:05:58", "text": "變速箱，當我做一次或"}]